# The explorer does not follow the disk by itself; "Refresh file explorer" in the
# palette reads the folder again. out.txt is made by saving a new document, and the
# explorer, which had one file, has two after the refresh.
# files a.txt=A
# open a.txt
# frames 14
# expect sidebar 1 2 first 0
# file out.txt=hello
1 key b ctrl
2 key n ctrl
3 text hello
4 key s ctrl
5 text out.txt
6 key enter
7 key p ctrl
8 text Refresh
9 key enter
